OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will
OL,6,Fbecome breezy as a band of rain
OL,7,Farrives from the southwest this
OL,8,Fevening. The rain will become heavy at
OL,9,Ftimes during the early hours, with
OL,10,Fsome sleet for a time over the Peak
OL,11,FDistrict. Feeling cold.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA damp start on Tuesday with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain through the morning,
OL,15,Fsometimes heavy, turning drier later.
OL,16,FA milder day than yesterday, but
OL,17,Fbreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
