OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,6,Fchangeable few days ahead, remaining
OL,7,Fchilly with blustery showers on
OL,8,FWednesday. Further outbreaks of rain
OL,9,Fon Thursday, before winds ease and
OL,10,Fbrighter skies return on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
